    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_student1_01",
      "hash64": "8EF4D37E104353CA",
      "text": "Finalmente siamo arrivati!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_student2_01",
      "hash64": "3CE71399CB93CFBD",
      "text": "Prima l’aereo, poi la corriera...! A forza di stare\\ntutto il tempo seduti mi fa male il sedere...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_01",
      "hash64": "EC547B8D853E0202",
      "text": "Ahahah! Eh già, il viaggio è stato lungo![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_02",
      "hash64": "EC547A8D853E004F",
      "text": "Allora ci siamo tutti, giusto?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_students_01",
      "hash64": "BD78057B68BC1668",
      "text": "Sììì!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_03",
      "hash64": "EC54798D853DFE9C",
      "text": "Bene, eccoci a Nordivia![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_04",
      "hash64": "EC54788D853DFCE9",
      "text": "Qui si svolgerà il nostro viaggio di studio.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_05",
      "hash64": "EC54778D853DFB36",
      "text": "In realtà, è la prima volta che ci vengo anch’io.\\c\\nDevo dire che questi campi sono di una bellezza\\nsfolgorante![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_06",
      "hash64": "EC54768D853DF983",
      "text": "Più avanti c’è Verdegiada, il paesino che ci farà\\nda base operativa durante la nostra permanenza.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_student3_01",
      "hash64": "6765878E822BE528",
      "text": "Ehm... Scusi, professoressa... Io... non mi sento\\nmolto bene...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_07",
      "hash64": "EC54758D853DF7D0",
      "text": "Oh no! Dev’essere stata la corriera.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_08",
      "hash64": "EC54848D853E114D",
      "text": "Forse è meglio fare una pausa. Così ne\\napprofittiamo per ammirare il panorama.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_09",
      "hash64": "EC54838D853E0F9A",
      "text": "Posso parlarti un momento, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_10",
      "hash64": "EC50F68D853AEA2C",
      "text": "Avrei bisogno di un favore.\\c\\nAndresti a Verdegiada ad avvisare il responsabile\\ndel circolo comunale che siamo arrivati?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_11",
      "hash64": "EC50F78D853AEBDF",
      "text": "Se non ti dispiace, potresti anche dirgli che\\nc’è uno studente che non si sente bene?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_select_01",
      "hash64": "0B5A1531CC6F91AC",
      "text": "D’accordo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_select_02",
      "hash64": "0B5A1831CC6F96C5",
      "text": "Ci vado subito!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_12",
      "hash64": "EC50F88D853AED92",
      "text": "Sapevo di poter contare su di te.\\c\\nIo intanto mi prenderò cura del nostro piccolo\\nmalato.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_student1_02",
      "hash64": "8EF4D27E10435217",
      "text": "È la prima volta che vado all’estero!\\nSi respira un’aria diversa rispetto a casa.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_student2_02",
      "hash64": "3CE71099CB93CAA4",
      "text": "Poverino... Spero che non stia troppo male.\\nLa strada era abbastanza dissestata.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_student3_02",
      "hash64": "67658A8E822BEA41",
      "text": "Ugh... Che mal di testa... Adesso capisco come\\nsi sentono gli Psyduck.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
